Metric:
- id: tagging.coverage
- name: Tagging Coverage
- description: Tagging Coverage measures the percentage of cloud resources that are appropriately labeled with essential business tags, such as environment (env), owner, cost center, and service. This metric is crucial for effective resource management, as it enables organizations to track and allocate costs accurately, ensuring financial accountability. By assessing tagging coverage, organizations can identify gaps in resource visibility and ownership, which can hinder operational efficiency and compliance. A high tagging coverage percentage indicates a well-organized cloud environment, facilitating better reporting and governance. Conversely, low coverage may lead to challenges in cost optimization and resource utilization.

