Metric:
- id: security.encryption
- name: Security – Encryption
- description: This metric measures the adoption and implementation of encryption protocols for data at rest and in transit across cloud assets and endpoints. It evaluates the extent to which sensitive information is protected through encryption mechanisms, ensuring that unauthorized access is mitigated. The focus is on modern encryption standards, including TLS (Transport Layer Security), which secures data during transmission. By assessing encryption practices, this metric helps organizations understand their security posture and compliance with industry regulations. A higher adoption rate indicates a stronger defense against data breaches and enhances overall data integrity.

